description: Boot the installed FreeDOS disk and confirm a DOS prompt
platform: dos
timeout: 120

# boot the hard disk, not the LiveCD
detach cdrom
restart
# the FreeDOS boot menu proceeds on its own default
wait "C:\>"
screenshot
enter "fdapm poweroff"
wait shutdown
